  <header class="page-hero">
    <h1>Workshop code of conduct</h1>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>RESI’s December 4, 2026 workshop welcomes open inquiry, respectful scientific debate, and people from all backgrounds. All attendees, speakers, organizers, and staff are expected to treat one another with respect.</p>
    <p>Harassment, discrimination, bullying, intimidation, and retaliation are not acceptable. This includes personal abuse, repeated disruption of sessions, stalking, unwelcome sexual attention, and inappropriate physical contact. Respect others’ boundaries and stop unwanted conduct when asked.</p>
    <p>For questions or to report a conduct concern, contact <a href="mailto:hello@resi.org">hello@resi.org</a>.</p>
    <p><a href="/workshops/safe-by-design-superintelligence/#directions">Back to the workshop</a></p>
  </div>
